10
00:01:09,012 --> 00:01:11,068
Chase !

11
00:01:11,088 --> 00:01:14,088
Refined to perfection.

12
00:01:16,044 --> 00:01:20,080
Never retreat, no matter the danger.

13
00:01:20,092 --> 00:01:23,084
I dare to defy the heavens !

14
00:01:24,032 --> 00:01:27,068
Always overcome the obstacles,

15
00:01:27,087 --> 00:01:30,004
