72
00:08:15,072 --> 00:08:16,039
Blood Ancestor !

73
00:08:26,032 --> 00:08:27,051
Fourth soul,

74
00:08:28,064 --> 00:08:29,067
get into position !

75
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:38,067
Using a rank 6 Celestial King as a formation spirit

76
00:08:39,016 --> 00:08:40,047
