77
00:08:41,004 --> 00:08:42,007
Do you have

78
00:08:43,024 --> 00:08:44,075
a Celestial Lord ?

79
00:08:46,048 --> 00:08:47,099
Of course.

80
00:09:06,096 --> 00:09:07,067
This pressure...

81
00:09:07,096 --> 00:09:09,083
I've only felt it from the All-Seer !

82
00:09:11,020 --> 00:09:12,083
Such extraordinary experts

83
00:09:13,040 --> 00:09:15,060
