84
00:09:20,072 --> 00:09:23,044
Rank 1 Celestial Lords of the Thunder Celestial Realm !

85
00:09:23,076 --> 00:09:25,079
Third soul, second soul,

86
00:09:26,056 --> 00:09:27,023
get into position !

87
00:09:32,068 --> 00:09:34,071
One last one remains.

88
00:10:09,016 --> 00:10:10,019
Just its killing intent

89
00:10:11,016 --> 00:10:12,059
