92
00:10:37,052 --> 00:10:39,015
First soul,

93
00:10:39,060 --> 00:10:40,079
get into position.

94
00:10:51,040 --> 00:10:52,080
Celestial Formation,

95
00:10:53,076 --> 00:10:54,079
activate !

96
00:10:57,092 --> 00:11:00,000
This formation now has world-destroying power...

97
00:11:00,060 --> 00:11:02,001
But why did Master Flamespark

98
00:11:02,004 --> 00:11:04,039
go through the trouble of luring Qing Shui here ?

99
00:11:06,016 --> 00:11:06,095
Nice formation.

100
00:11:08,032 --> 00:11:10,020
Although this Celestial Formation is powerful,

101
00:11:10,032 --> 00:11:12,019
it still lacks sharpness.

102
00:11:13,032 --> 00:11:16,039
I understand now why you're after me.

103
00:11:17,096 --> 00:11:19,047
That's correct.

104
00:11:20,024 --> 00:11:21,035
I invited you here

105
00:11:21,060 --> 00:11:23,035
precisely so you can help me

106
00:11:23,084 --> 00:11:26,000
to complete the Celestial Formation with your Ji Realm !

107
00:11:26,008 --> 00:11:27,059
May I ask Celestial Lord Qing Shui

108
00:11:27,076 --> 00:11:29,011
what you think of this ?

109
00:11:29,028 --> 00:11:30,063
I told you before

110
00:11:31,036 --> 00:11:32,079
that I'm not Qing Shui !

111
00:11:35,052 --> 00:11:37,023
It seems your memory

112
00:11:37,056 --> 00:11:40,047
has been sleeping within the seal for too long...

113
00:11:41,016 --> 00:11:42,011
But today,

114
00:11:42,056 --> 00:11:44,036
I shall use this Celestial Descent Platform

115
00:11:44,040 --> 00:11:45,071
to help you remember !

116
00:11:46,068 --> 00:11:49,052
This old man has been to the Celestial Realm hundreds of times

117
00:11:49,056 --> 00:11:51,008
and read countless ancient jades

118
00:11:51,012 --> 00:11:52,047
until I found this one !

119
00:11:54,004 --> 00:11:55,067
What this jade slip records

120
00:11:56,024 --> 00:11:59,028
is precisely the life of Celestial Emperor Bai Fan's disciple,

121
00:11:59,040 --> 00:12:02,031
Celestial Lord Qing Shui.

122
00:12:05,052 --> 00:12:07,035
Your name is Qing Shui.

123
00:12:08,028 --> 00:12:11,091
You were a crown prince in the ancient cultivation world, in the Clear Water State.

124
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:15,012
When you ascended to the Celestial Realm back then,

125
00:12:15,036 --> 00:12:16,087
you came to this very place,

126
00:12:17,072 --> 00:12:19,011
the Celestial Descent Platform.

127
00:12:21,016 --> 00:12:22,067
And it was also here

128
00:12:23,024 --> 00:12:24,095
that you met Celestial Emperor Bai Fan

129
00:12:25,032 --> 00:12:27,012
and were taken as his disciple.

130
00:12:27,088 --> 00:12:29,083
During the next tens of thousands of years,

131
00:12:30,044 --> 00:12:32,071
you followed Bai Fan in campaigns across the lands

132
00:12:32,084 --> 00:12:34,019
to expand his territory.

133
00:12:36,024 --> 00:12:38,007
You brought honor to your family.

134
00:12:38,016 --> 00:12:40,012
How glorious it was...

135
00:12:42,024 --> 00:12:43,063
But overnight,

136
00:12:43,068 --> 00:12:45,023
Dear ! What's wrong with you ?

137
00:12:44,072 --> 00:12:46,015
You lost your mind

138
00:12:46,060 --> 00:12:48,032
and fell to a demonic possession.

139
00:12:48,092 --> 00:12:50,043
Everyone around you

140
00:12:50,080 --> 00:12:52,067
died by your hand.

141
00:13:00,004 --> 00:13:02,011
You possessed the Ji Realm,

142
00:13:02,040 --> 00:13:04,003
so naturally, no one could stand against you.

143
00:13:04,028 --> 00:13:06,000
You slaughtered countless people.

144
00:13:06,048 --> 00:13:07,027
That's how

145
00:13:07,080 --> 00:13:10,023
you brought about the most tragic calamity

146
00:13:10,056 --> 00:13:12,031
since the creation of the Thunder Celestial Realm.

147
00:13:14,096 --> 00:13:16,051
Then your master,

148
00:13:16,092 --> 00:13:19,031
Celestial Emperor Bai Fan, personally arrived,

149
00:13:23,084 --> 00:13:26,012
and helpd you regain your senses.

150
00:13:26,044 --> 00:13:28,027
But the damage had already been done.

151
00:13:37,044 --> 00:13:38,019
Yan'er !

152
00:13:44,052 --> 00:13:45,007
No...

153
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:46,039
No...

154
00:13:49,052 --> 00:13:50,011
Impossible...

155
00:13:56,088 --> 00:13:57,051
Yan'er,

156
00:13:58,024 --> 00:13:59,003
wake up.

157
00:13:59,084 --> 00:14:00,051
It's me,

158
00:14:01,008 --> 00:14:02,007
I'm back.

159
00:14:15,060 --> 00:14:16,055
Yan'er !

160
00:14:18,016 --> 00:14:19,051
Nooo !!!

161
00:14:38,072 --> 00:14:39,055
That day,

162
00:14:40,004 --> 00:14:43,003
you split your own body apart in your despair,

163
00:14:43,064 --> 00:14:45,023
and sealed it with artifacts

164
00:14:45,044 --> 00:14:47,043
to condemn yourself to never be reborn.

165
00:14:48,056 --> 00:14:49,083
Bai Fan couldn't bear it,

166
00:14:50,036 --> 00:14:53,023
so he placed a healing formation outside the seals

167
00:14:54,040 --> 00:14:58,027
in hope that you would awaken one day.

168
00:15:04,004 --> 00:15:06,019
If you help me to complete this formation,

169
00:15:06,072 --> 00:15:09,059
I will find the cause of your demonic possession.

170
00:15:10,064 --> 00:15:11,051
After that,

171
00:15:12,024 --> 00:15:14,047
you'll be able to avenge your loved ones !

172
00:15:16,032 --> 00:15:17,056
He gathered formation spirits,

173
00:15:17,064 --> 00:15:18,084
raised Thunder Beasts,

174
00:15:19,000 --> 00:15:20,028
and refined the Celestial Realm...

175
00:15:21,024 --> 00:15:22,079
To make Qing Shui help him,

176
00:15:23,040 --> 00:15:24,091
he investigated for tens of thousands of years.

177
00:15:27,024 --> 00:15:28,083
This man's behavior seems crazy

178
00:15:29,056 --> 00:15:30,075
but in reality, every move he makes

179
00:15:31,072 --> 00:15:32,088
is planned meticulously.

180
00:15:33,008 --> 00:15:33,083
Enough !

181
00:15:41,048 --> 00:15:42,003
Qing Shui,

182
00:15:42,056 --> 00:15:44,028
I've helped you recover your memories

183
00:15:44,028 --> 00:15:45,020
out of good will !

184
00:15:45,020 --> 00:15:46,027
What do you mean by this ?

185
00:15:51,036 --> 00:15:52,003
Could he...

186
00:15:52,024 --> 00:15:54,035
have been overtaken by his demonic thoughts once again ?

187
00:15:55,068 --> 00:15:57,008
That shouldn't be possible.

188
00:15:57,072 --> 00:15:59,027
I had finally forgotten...

189
00:16:00,020 --> 00:16:01,031
Why did you...

190
00:16:02,004 --> 00:16:04,031
have to remind me ?

191
00:16:18,076 --> 00:16:20,015
Call the Wind !

192
00:16:35,012 --> 00:16:37,048
Celestial Formation, assemble origin !

193
00:16:47,028 --> 00:16:48,007
This is...

194
00:16:48,084 --> 00:16:50,047
the true power of Call the Wind !

195
00:16:55,036 --> 00:16:56,039
Celestial Lord Qing Shui,

196
00:16:56,088 --> 00:16:57,059
do you know

197
00:16:57,096 --> 00:16:59,047
that not long after you were sealed,

198
00:16:59,072 --> 00:17:01,091
your master Bai Fan died under mysterious circumstances

199
00:17:02,032 --> 00:17:04,035
and the Thunder Celestial Realm collapsed soon after ?

200
00:17:04,076 --> 00:17:05,067
Don't you want to...

201
00:17:05,068 --> 00:17:06,051
Shut up !

202
00:17:08,056 --> 00:17:09,059
Summon the Rain !

203
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:16,087
Ice Seal !

204
00:17:22,008 --> 00:17:22,099
After Call the Wind

205
00:17:23,048 --> 00:17:24,039
comes Summon the Rain.

206
00:17:25,024 --> 00:17:26,084
The Celestial Emperor's spells

207
00:17:26,096 --> 00:17:28,072
are truly extraordinary.

208
00:17:29,004 --> 00:17:29,095
Qing Shui,

209
00:17:30,056 --> 00:17:33,011
Your best choice is to join forces with me.

210
00:17:33,096 --> 00:17:35,059
You and I are not enemies.

211
00:17:36,020 --> 00:17:39,007
Don't refuse my kind offer only to end up with a worse one !

212
00:17:42,024 --> 00:17:43,071
You need to restore your cultivation

213
00:17:43,076 --> 00:17:45,076
and require a massive amount of origin energy.

214
00:17:45,084 --> 00:17:47,091
Come with me to the Alliance Star System

215
00:17:48,024 --> 00:17:50,015
and devour strong cultivators there.

216
00:17:50,080 --> 00:17:52,015
With my help,

217
00:17:52,056 --> 00:17:54,075
your cultivation will soon return to its peak !

218
00:17:56,092 --> 00:17:57,099
That reason

219
00:17:58,064 --> 00:17:59,072
isn't enough !

220
00:18:10,092 --> 00:18:11,055
As expected...

221
00:18:12,028 --> 00:18:13,068
Just some residual energy

222
00:18:13,080 --> 00:18:16,019
is enough to take my life.

223
00:18:16,040 --> 00:18:18,096
I found that when you fell into demonic possession back then,

224
00:18:19,004 --> 00:18:21,027
someone in the Rain Celestial Realm also suffered the same fate.

225
00:18:23,028 --> 00:18:24,051
If you help me,

226
00:18:25,000 --> 00:18:27,099
I will provide you with the clues and the survivors !

227
00:18:29,016 --> 00:18:30,004
Not enough !

228
00:18:33,004 --> 00:18:35,047
The Cultivation Alliance has a scroll within its archives

229
00:18:35,080 --> 00:18:38,035
that surfaced shortly after the Celestial Realm collapsed.

230
00:18:39,000 --> 00:18:42,047
This item is deeply connected to the destruction of the Celestial Realm !

231
00:18:43,036 --> 00:18:44,083
Your demonic possession,

232
00:18:45,012 --> 00:18:46,031
Bai Fan's death,

233
00:18:47,000 --> 00:18:48,059
and the fall of the Celestial Realm

234
00:18:49,028 --> 00:18:52,015
have all been orchestrated by the same thing !

235
00:18:52,072 --> 00:18:54,083
Don't you want to uncover the truth

236
00:18:55,024 --> 00:18:56,075
and avenge your loved one ?

237
00:19:35,044 --> 00:19:36,067
If you lied to me,

238
00:19:37,056 --> 00:19:38,099
I will detonate the Ji Realm

239
00:19:40,008 --> 00:19:41,051
and reduce this formation

240
00:19:41,080 --> 00:19:43,059
to dust.

241
00:19:48,084 --> 00:19:50,023
Celestial Lord can rest assured,

242
00:19:50,088 --> 00:19:51,075
this old man

243
00:19:52,008 --> 00:19:53,044
is not lying !

244
00:20:10,020 --> 00:20:11,087
Celestial Lord, come with me

245
00:20:11,088 --> 00:20:13,071
to meet my friends in the Allheaven Star System.

246
00:20:14,012 --> 00:20:14,092
And then,

247
00:20:14,096 --> 00:20:16,044
we will open a passage

248
00:20:16,048 --> 00:20:17,091
straight to the Alliance Star System

249
00:20:18,040 --> 00:20:20,019
and turn it upside down !

250
00:20:23,004 --> 00:20:24,012
Senior, please wait !

251
00:20:27,052 --> 00:20:29,011
Congratulations on completing the formation.

252
00:20:30,020 --> 00:20:31,038
Could you give Junior

253
00:20:31,048 --> 00:20:32,071
his Thunder Beast back ?

254
00:20:34,032 --> 00:20:36,035
I still need your Thunder Beast for a few more days.

255
00:20:37,004 --> 00:20:39,035
After I open the passage to the Alliance,

256
00:20:39,052 --> 00:20:40,055
I will return it to you.

257
00:20:42,044 --> 00:20:43,055
Little guy,

258
00:20:43,092 --> 00:20:45,067
you are fated with me.

259
00:20:46,056 --> 00:20:48,099
If you can leave the Thunder Celestial Realm safely,

260
00:20:50,000 --> 00:20:52,003
take this token to the Thunder Celestial Temple

261
00:20:52,072 --> 00:20:55,019
and I will grant you another fortuitous opportunity.

262
00:20:58,000 --> 00:20:59,079
Since you have learned Call the Wind,

263
00:21:00,024 --> 00:21:02,015
you still count as my master's disciple.

264
00:21:02,080 --> 00:21:03,035
Remember,

265
00:21:04,020 --> 00:21:06,087
this spell is one of the 6 great spells he created.

266
00:21:07,064 --> 00:21:10,015
Don't let it gather dust in your hands.

267
00:21:22,020 --> 00:21:23,081
The Celestial Realm Gate was destroyed.

268
00:21:24,004 --> 00:21:24,087
There is only one way

269
00:21:25,068 --> 00:21:26,047
to leave this place.

270
00:21:27,088 --> 00:21:29,016
To enter and exit the Thunder Celestial Realm

271
00:21:29,020 --> 00:21:30,036
apart from the Celestial Gate,

272
00:21:30,040 --> 00:21:33,000
there are ancient teleportation formations controlled by the Thunder Celestial Temple.

273
00:21:33,024 --> 00:21:34,015
I have

274
00:21:34,028 --> 00:21:35,093
placed their location within my Dao Soul

275
00:21:36,004 --> 00:21:37,072
so Master can use them if needed.

276
00:22:01,071 --> 00:24:35,092
The State of Clear Water is an important part of in the lore of the Er Gen universe. For instance, it's heavily referenced in I Shall Seal the Heavens. They added in a lot of details in the scenes of this episode which is a very nice touch !\N\NClear Water is the literal translation of Qing Shui. For simplicity's sake, we will refer to the character as Qing Shui and his country as Clear Water.

